# Exported fight logs. One is written every time a bout is watched, they run to hundreds of
# kilobytes each, and they are regenerable by watching another fight — so they are output, not
# source, and do not belong in the history. Delete the ignore line if a specific bout is ever
# worth keeping as evidence.
*-HALL_OF_FAMER-*.txt
*-WORLD_CLASS-*.txt
*-ELITE-*.txt
*-GOOD-*.txt
*-PRO-*.txt
*-AMATEUR-*.txt
